    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel like it's being blown out of proportion. the hole isn't even that big once the blood stops. if i just use some heavy duty antiseptic like betadine or even some triple antibiotic ointment and keep it bandaged up can't i just keep an eye on it for a few days and only go in if it actually starts swelling or hurting? seems like a waste of money to go in just for a tiny scratch",
